                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Finch to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Finch reports that the military leader of the revolution, Sera via, is
                    dead.)</p>
